---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
import FinalCTA from '@/components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Launching Hard Rock Bet Across Six States"
  description=""
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 1: HERO
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-hero section">
  <div class="cs-hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">— Case Study</span>
      <h1>Launching Hard Rock Bet Across Six States</h1>
      <p class="cs-hero-desc">
        When the Seminole Tribe of Florida secured a historic gaming compact, they needed a brand and marketing engine to launch the first legal sportsbook in the state — and then scale it nationally. As VP of Brand Marketing, I built Hard Rock Bet from brand inception through six state launches, exceeding acquisition forecasts by 232%.
      </p>
      <div class="cs-hero-meta">
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Company</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Hard Rock Digital</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Industry</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Sports Betting / Gaming</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Scope</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Multi-State (6 Markets)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Focus</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Brand Launch &amp; Growth</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-hero-image">
                <img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d84514_dbb68c529f1145b08893fe4cbfa525e2~mv2.png" alt="Hard Rock Bet marketing collage" />
            </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 2: RESULTS STRIP
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-results-strip section">
  <div class="cs-results-strip-inner">
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">+232%</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Exceeded Acquisition Forecasts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">6</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">State Launches</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">+17%</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">ARPU Above Target</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">1st</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Legal Sportsbook in Florida</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 3: THE SITUATION
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-section section">
  <span class="eyebrow">— The Situation</span>
  <h2>Building a Sportsbook Brand from Scratch in a Crowded Market</h2>
  <p>
    The U.S. sports betting market was exploding with well-funded competitors like DraftKings and FanDuel spending billions on customer acquisition. Hard Rock Digital needed to launch a sportsbook that could compete immediately — but the brand, marketing infrastructure, and go-to-market strategy didn't exist yet.
  </p>
  <div class="cs-challenge-grid">
    <ul class="cs-challenge-list">
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">1</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>Entering a market dominated by well-funded incumbents.</strong> DraftKings and FanDuel had already spent billions on brand awareness and customer acquisition, making market entry extremely competitive.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">2</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>No existing sportsbook brand or marketing infrastructure.</strong> Hard Rock Bet needed everything built from the ground up — brand identity, creative systems, media strategy, and acquisition engine.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">3</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>Massive Florida launch with national ambitions.</strong> The first legal sportsbook in Florida was a high-stakes debut, with immediate plans to expand across five additional states.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">4</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>Retention was the real battleground.</strong> In a category where sign-up bonuses drive switching, building lasting engagement beyond the first bet was critical to long-term profitability.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cs-callout">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-lt)">— The Mandate</span>
      <blockquote>
        Build a sportsbook brand from scratch that can compete with billion-dollar incumbents — then scale it across six states while exceeding acquisition and revenue targets.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 4: THE APPROACH
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="cs-approach section">
  <div class="cs-section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— The Approach</span>
    <h2>Win the Launch Moment, Then Build Beyond the First Bet</h2>
    <p>
      The strategy rested on two pillars: dominate each state launch window to capture outsized market share, then build engagement systems that drove long-term value beyond the initial sign-up bonus. Every campaign was designed to move bettors from trial to habitual engagement.
    </p>
    <div class="cs-phases">
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">01</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Win the Launch Moment</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Orchestrated high-impact, coordinated launches in each state — combining brand awareness blitzes, strategic media buys, and cultural tentpole activations to capture maximum attention in compressed launch windows.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="cs-phase-tool">Go-to-Market Strategy →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">02</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Build Engagement Beyond the First Bet</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Identified key activation behaviors — second bet within 48 hours, betting across multiple sports, using live in-play betting — and built campaigns specifically designed to drive these high-value actions.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">03</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Scalable Multi-State Playbook</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Built a repeatable launch framework that could be localized for each market — adapting messaging, media mix, and cultural hooks for Florida, Arizona, New Jersey, and beyond while maintaining brand consistency.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Integrated Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">04</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Data-Driven Acquisition Engine</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Built performance marketing infrastructure that connected brand spend to acquisition outcomes, enabling real-time optimization across channels and markets. Measured every dollar against customer lifetime value, not just sign-up volume.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Content &amp; Creator Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>



<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 6: BEFORE / AFTER
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-ba section">
  <div class="cs-ba-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— Transformation</span>
    <h2>Before &amp; After Hard Rock Bet</h2>
    <div class="cs-ba-grid">
      <div class="cs-ba-before">
        <div class="cs-ba-label">Before</div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">No sportsbook brand, identity, or marketing infrastructure</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Entering a market dominated by DraftKings and FanDuel with multi-billion-dollar head starts</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">No legal sports betting in Florida — the third-largest state by population</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Acquisition-focused category with minimal retention strategy</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-ba-after">
        <div class="cs-ba-label">After</div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Full brand built from scratch — identity, creative systems, media strategy, and launch playbook</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Exceeded acquisition forecasts by 232% across six state launches</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">First legal sportsbook launched in Florida with massive market capture</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">ARPU 17% above target through engagement-first retention strategy</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 7: RESULTS DEEP DIVE
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-results section">
  <div class="cs-results-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— Results</span>
    <h2>
      The Numbers Tell the Story
    </h2>
    <p>
      A brand built from zero to multi-state sportsbook powerhouse — with results that shattered forecasts.
    </p>
    <div class="cs-results-grid">
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">+232%</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Exceeded Acquisition Forecasts</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Customer acquisition exceeded internal forecasts by 232% across all markets, driven by high-impact launch campaigns and performance marketing optimization.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:95%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">6</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">State Launches</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Successfully launched Hard Rock Bet across six states including Florida, Arizona, and New Jersey — using a repeatable playbook localized for each market.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:80%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">+17%</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">ARPU Above Target</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Average Revenue Per User exceeded targets by 17%, validating the engagement-first strategy that focused on activation behaviors beyond the initial sign-up bonus.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:75%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">1st</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Legal Sportsbook in Florida</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Launched the first legal sportsbook in the state of Florida — the third-largest state by population — capturing significant first-mover advantage in a massive market.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 8: IMPACT
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-impact section">
  <div class="cs-impact-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">— Impact</span>
  <h2>From Brand Inception to Multi-State Sportsbook</h2>
  <p>
    Hard Rock Bet proved that a well-built brand with a clear strategy could compete against entrenched incumbents — even in a category where competitors had multi-billion-dollar head starts. By combining high-impact launch moments with retention-focused engagement systems, the brand didn't just acquire customers; it built lasting value.
  </p>
  <p>
    The two-pillar strategy — win the launch moment, then build beyond the first bet — created a repeatable model for multi-state expansion that consistently outperformed forecasts in every market entered.
  </p>
  <div class="cs-impact-callout">
    <div class="cs-impact-icon">🎰</div>
    <div class="cs-impact-text">
      Hard Rock Bet went from brand inception to the first legal sportsbook in Florida — then scaled across six states while exceeding acquisition forecasts by 232% and delivering ARPU 17% above target.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 9: SERVICES USED
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-services section">
  <div class="cs-services-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">— Capabilities Applied</span>
  <h2>
    What This Took
  </h2>
  <div class="cs-services-pills">
    <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="cs-service-pill">Go-to-Market Strategy</a>
    <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Integrated Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Content &amp; Creator Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 10: CTA
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<FinalCTA />


    

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
